# ⌊%tid.x/3⌋ written as LLVM writes a division by a constant that is no
# power of two, the upper half of a product by a magic number and a
# shift: the tracer reads no mul.hi, and the store's address is unknown
# (PLAN, "Addresses the tracer cannot read").
RUN: %ptxroof analyze --annotate %fixtures/micro/magic_div.ptx | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r1; // global store addr ? (`mul.hi.u32` keeps a product's upper half){{$}}
